{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabbatical in Merzouga</strong> is a visual novel where you play as a student on a sabbatical. Explore the city of Merzouga and discover a creature that haunts you at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will determine the ending of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short branching narrative with player choices that shape the flow of the dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 dream nights where you interact with the worm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ending exclusive to the demo (the full version contains all 8 endings).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric background art of the cabin, desert, and worm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle sound design and music to heighten the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: around 10\u201315 minutes for one complete demo run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>DEMO version</strong> includes one ending, with a playtime around 25 minutes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012820?t=1759889598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012820?t=1759889598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012820/f10bf0a652c260f3d898c72a5f87a0be39e36b9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759889598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012820/f10bf0a652c260f3d898c72a5f87a0be39e36b9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759889598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabbatical in Merzouga</strong> is a visual novel where you play as a student on a sabbatical. Explore the city of Merzouga and discover a creature that haunts you at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make will determine the ending of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO GAME FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short branching narrative with player choices that shape the flow of the dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 dream nights where you interact with the worm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One ending exclusive to the demo (the full version contains all 8 endings).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric background art of the cabin, desert, and worm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle sound design and music to heighten the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: around 10\u201315 minutes for one complete demo run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>DEMO version</strong> includes one ending, with a playtime around 25 minutes.</p>","developers":["Feeling Potion"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4010330","name":"Sabbatical In Merzouga"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012820/614502a4ae298cc1d2e106e7fee39afb9cc52eda/header.jpg?t=1759889598","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 14.6.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ap